{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 31","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> handshakes were exchanged at the conclusion of a party. Assuming that each participant was equally polite toward all the others, the number of people present was: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/1/e21dd8a0b11c1eca7c55cff2f9fb9409e3d48907.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 14\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 28\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 56\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 8\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"376\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The handshake equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/378b7b8268b169c9ea9df303460b5b080b9a83d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h=\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"104\" height=\"38\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is the number of people and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is the number of handshakes. There were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> handshakes, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/9/f39fe9276027adfcb49b0062bd5dd3407ea3a8c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28=\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/5/655068303acb61f4a5111936cb7f74b64e6a8b46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56=n(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />\nThe factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/6392be3c4d257afbc7ed9283bdb8ba630f4ef7e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> are:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/0/5d0d5ec0bfede056138730c407574b8c852b7acb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 4, 7, 8, 14, 28, 56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"156\" height=\"16\" />.\nAs we can see, only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/3/2330894a1493f7d8e3a76cb62edc5d0be3ad4522.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7, 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" /> fit the requirements <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9d3407c16ac230a65d2dbb640f0d46dfe4e1807.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> was an integer.\nTherefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31a795ad7c24ca70cd85d20a3d6f795fcd0e46a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">Problem 32</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problem